WEBVTT

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:16.180
Is there anything you can do for us?

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.430
All right. Okay.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.680
I can go defend her.

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:22.770
Jolyne Cujoh, that is.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.730
I'll take care of this geezer!

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:32.940
Southeast, 127 degrees,
30 minutes and 20 seconds.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.160
This time, you will not survive.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.580
Face southwest, 225 degrees, 0 minutes.

00:00:44.660 --> 00:00:47.420
F.F., it's behind you!

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:52.300
I said, your enemy is the geezer!

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:59.350
His arm flew behind F.F's head!

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:07.730
Was that a coincidence just now?

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:11.860
That prisoner's glasses flew up
and stabbed F.F.'s face!

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:13.990
Unlucky direction.

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:15.860
I'm starting to understand it.

00:01:15.950 --> 00:01:17.660
He's using feng shui.

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:20.080
There is a principle called feng shui
in East Asia.

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:24.790
Kenzou uses that dragon-like Stand
to choose his direction of attack.

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.040
F.F., this area is your worst luck.

00:01:28.630 --> 00:01:30.790
Just above your left ear.

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:35.380
My attack overlapped with
your orientation of death!

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:51.270
F.F.!

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:56.610
No… this is seriously bad.

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:57.860
Stop.

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.450
You cannot save them.

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:03.830
The direction of our worst luck
exists for you and me as well.

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:09.330
And once it's decided,
no living being can escape it.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.040
It was proven to us just now.

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.670
Their next target

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:14.460
will be you.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:24.930
No.

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:29.640
I'm not talking about their head
getting chopped in half.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:35.230
I'd rather that
their head bleed profusely.

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:39.490
It's worse that
they're barely bleeding at all.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:43.620
All the damage has depleted
the water levels in their body.

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:46.700
The plankton in their body
are starting to die off!

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:49.960
I'm glad it's not gushing out.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:53.710
But that was the unluckiest direction,
without a doubt.

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:30.470
EPISODE 18: ENTER THE F.F.

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:34.190
What? Return to me, dragon!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:44.530
That almost finished you off, geezer!

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:45.570
Never…

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.030
Never again!

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:52.620
Never will I set my foot off of
the direction of safety!

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:59.630
Shit, he escaped to a safe area.

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:01.050
But…

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:04.800
I'm starting
to understand the orientations,

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:06.590
and ways around it!

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.470
A mirror… I need to make a mirror!

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:14.850
If only there was a mirror midair,
then I can reflect that dragon on it.

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:19.150
I can trick Kenzou into stepping
towards a fake direction of safety.

00:05:19.230 --> 00:05:21.610
Then, I'd have a chance to beat him down.

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:25.280
But first, I must have water.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:31.990
I can make a mirror out of water.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:35.120
I need water to heal
from all the damage too,

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:39.630
but right now, I need to replenish
on water to create a mirror midair!

00:05:39.710 --> 00:05:43.840
In the past, over 30,000 believers

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:50.260
followed my teachings
and walked in my steps.

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:54.810
But ever since I came to this prison,
my life has changed.

00:05:54.890 --> 00:05:56.560
I'm mocked.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:59.350
Everyone mocks me and laughs at me.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:05.740
Even a pedophile
who kidnapped children ridiculed me.

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:07.450
Forty years…

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:10.450
I've suffered this for 40 years!

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:13.910
I was once respected!

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:18.210
Forty years ago, I basked in glory!

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:20.710
And those days will come again.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:25.250
The feng shui which saved me
from the ravaging fire

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:27.670
has now taken form as my Stand!

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:32.300
I will reign as Founder once again!

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:36.310
Though I may fail to break out of here,
fervent followers will return to me!

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:40.390
After I finish you off, that is!

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:42.690
Now, meet your end!

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:45.110
Drake's Dream!

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:48.440
Reveal to me
the direction of the finishing blow!

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.950
F.F., just beyond the stairs!

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:57.120
There's a fire hose!

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:07.800
Hey, you.

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:12.550
Don't just stand there and explain things.
Go help F.F.!

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:13.930
You have a Stand, don't you?

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:17.010
Fight with F.F. to finish off that geezer!

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:19.350
Only if F.F. dies.

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:24.440
My terms do not include helping F.F.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:27.190
Our deal only extends to saving you.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:31.950
Besides, F.F. themself
said they don't want any help.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:35.240
When they saw your injuries,

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:40.160
F.F. directed me to protect you from
the enemies in this Disciplinary Wing.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:43.040
Where is it?

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:44.750
How do I make water come out?

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.750
Where is the valve?

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:55.930
Don't come here.
This area contains your worst luck yet.

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:57.470
Guard against it at all costs.

00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:01.310
Or else, you will be dealt
a decisive and fatal blow.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.730
You don't have time to drink water!

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.320
Of their own volition?

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:17.450
F.F., what the hell are you doing?

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.660
The attack against you has been decided!

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.870
What are you thinking?

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:42.180
F.F. must have water above anything else.

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.730
Even in the way of a decided attack

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:46.520
or the zone of worst luck.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:50.650
They got rid of their arms on purpose
so that they could fit into that hose.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:55.780
They did it! They finally have water--

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:05.210
That's your own arm.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:07.250
Here comes the assassination feng shui.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:10.840
Looks like you desperately wanted water,

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:14.590
but you will never be at an advantage
from now on.

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:18.470
My attack will only bring you
the worst luck.

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:23.310
Such is the assassination feng shui,
Drake's Dream!

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:26.770
That's what it means
to have your fate sealed!

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:30.980
They couldn't reach water.
They didn't even touch it!

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:33.820
What happens now?

00:09:33.900 --> 00:09:37.450
Underneath this Disciplinary Wing
is the execution room.

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:41.990
The State of Florida
permits the death penalty.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.660
Two or three prisoners a year

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:49.630
are executed on
a 2,800-volt electric chair.

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.600
D-damn…

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:11.400
I was so close to touching the water.

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:13.400
But I did bust the pipe.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:15.650
I need to reach the water
upstairs somehow.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.110
At this rate, I'll…

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:25.240
Plankton like them
would perish in an instant.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.000
Shit!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:29.500
This chair, it can't be!

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:39.720
What? Don't tell me it's already on!

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.760
Does that sound mean
the electricity is ready to run?

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.680
Bullshit!

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:46.560
I won't let it run!

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:56.650
Let's see what kind of an end
you'll meet with my attacks.

00:10:57.440 --> 00:11:02.570
Anyone can predict the outcome
of this situation at this point.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:04.330
Before it turns on,

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:08.080
I will get the drops of water
dripping from the ceiling!

00:11:29.770 --> 00:11:34.650
Looks like your place on that chair
was already decided by fate.

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:37.190
Take this!

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:44.450
Behold, you will never obtain water.

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.830
And that was right on time.

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:49.790
You will now meet your end!

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.930
STAND NAME: F.F.
STAND MASTER: F.F.

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:11.770
F.F.!

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:17.230
The absolute orientation of attack
and flawless direction of defense.

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:19.110
Assassination feng shui.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:24.450
It took 40 years,
but I can now say I have mastered it.

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:27.580
The Founder reigns again!

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:33.210
With this, I'll go down in history
as a Buddha equal to Shakyamuni!

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:38.590
You know I'm supposed to stay neutral.

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:42.420
I'm in no position
to tell you this, geezer.

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:46.050
But F.F. finally got
the water they wanted.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:50.720
If it weren't for your kick,
they wouldn't have had any.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:55.600
You ran a little too much,
you 78-year-old man.

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:59.770
You can't help but sweat when
they had you running all over the place.

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:04.530
And your perspiration
became the water they needed.

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:10.080
F.F. made a mirror out of your sweat.

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:13.450
With enough sweat
to fill a third of a cup,

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.210
they can form a floating mirror.

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:20.090
What I'm saying is that
you're seeing my reflection.

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:24.300
So you are by no means standing
in the orientation of safety.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.590
It's a draw.

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:31.600
The only chance
at defeating assassination feng shui

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.180
is a draw.

00:13:33.270 --> 00:13:36.140
They have braced themself for this moment.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:40.560
That's right, take this.

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:43.230
I'll share this unluckiest fate with you!

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.900
The direction of safety…

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:54.540
F.F.…

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:59.170
It's over.

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.710
On to the next.

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:05.210
You wanted to look for the bone, right?
We must start thinking ahead.

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:12.260
At the least, you won't fall victim
to Kenzou's assassination feng shui now.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:16.230
It was indeed a formidable Stand.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:22.480
F.F.!

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:27.030
Inconceivable.

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:30.200
Jolyne Cujoh, what are you doing?

00:14:30.280 --> 00:14:34.370
Your body has suffered
more damage than you realize!

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:37.290
The colony of plankton inside F.F.'s body

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:40.620
has already been wiped out
by 2,800 volts of electricity.

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:42.250
You know better than anyone else!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:47.670
B-But the dragon…

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:53.350
The dragon is still here!

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:56.720
They must have let go of him
a moment too early.

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:58.930
Or it could be that plankton

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:01.310
are more susceptible to electricity
than humans.

00:15:01.400 --> 00:15:04.770
Kenzou is still alive!

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:13.160
Wait! You cannot manifest
your Stand with that body!

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:15.740
Has revenge driven you mad?

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:19.290
I won't let him stay alive like this.

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:23.210
Stone Ocean!

00:15:32.720 --> 00:15:34.550
You cannot hit me.

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:39.350
I will finish you and reign
as the Founder once again!

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:41.060
I see it now.

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:44.360
So that's the direction of safety.

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:45.730
So I see.

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:49.900
You were after Kenzou's
direction of safety.

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:52.240
Once you identified

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:55.620
the direction impervious
from every attack,

00:15:55.700 --> 00:16:01.620
then F.F., who scattered along with
the mirror, should be safe in this spot.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:05.330
The plankton there should've been
safe from the 2,800 volts.

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:09.420
You attacked him to find this exact spot.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:18.470
F.F. survived.

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:20.980
Good grief.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:24.520
How could this be?

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:26.020
Jolyne!

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:29.020
You think you've won now, do you?

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:32.700
You think you have defeated me?

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:34.530
Jolyne Cujoh.

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:38.700
There is no change in my plans
to defeat you.

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:41.040
You haven't noticed, now have you?

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:43.290
You have already…

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:48.040
stepped inside
my assassination feng shui's direction!

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:52.720
My thread is inside the dragon!

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:55.680
The attack is absolute!

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:58.140
Your worst luck has now been decided!

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:04.730
It doesn't matter how I choose to attack,
because your defeat is already decided!

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:13.400
I won!

00:17:14.150 --> 00:17:15.900
Now, kneel before me!

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:21.540
The Founder's reign cannot be altered!

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:32.500
What? Hey…

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:36.300
I dealt a blow, didn't I, Drake's Dream?

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:38.890
Assassination feng shui is absolute.

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:45.390
My deadly kick should have
defeated Jolyne, isn't that right?

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:48.980
Yeah, she couldn't dodge your deadly blow.

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:51.360
Then how is Jolyne unscathed,

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:55.110
while I'm clinging to this fence?

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:56.030
What?

00:17:56.530 --> 00:18:00.070
Dragon, show me the direction of safety…

00:18:04.660 --> 00:18:08.080
Come now, dragon, why are you moving away?

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:13.550
Tell me the direction of safety!
Why won't you come closer?

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:17.130
I want to ask that myself.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:19.970
You are the one getting farther away.

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:24.770
You let go of that railing,
and now you are falling down.

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:38.320
Why are you just blabbering?

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:41.160
I said, tell me the direction!

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:45.290
I told you,
you are the one getting farther away.

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:48.080
Geezer, look at your own legs.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:49.870
Something is really wrong with it.

00:18:49.960 --> 00:18:52.670
There's something off about them.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:56.840
You could have gotten attacked
when you kicked Jolyne.

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.050
Oh, that's…

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:06.560
What the hell?
That's not her thread Stand!

00:19:06.640 --> 00:19:11.230
What is that Stand emerging
out of Jolyne Cujoh's body?

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:12.730
Diver Drive.

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:15.730
I submerged it into her body.

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:19.070
Though the attack on Jolyne was decided,

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:23.320
it protected her precisely
at the moment of your blow.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:29.750
What the hell?

00:19:45.050 --> 00:19:47.220
This man who came with F.F.,

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:48.560
Anastasia.

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:51.640
He put his own Stand into my body

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:55.360
and destroyed Kenzou's legs in an instant.

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:59.320
His bones and muscles
were entirely disassembled.

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:04.200
They were then rearranged
into this spring-like shape.

00:20:04.280 --> 00:20:06.660
It is now a suspension
made of meat and bones.

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:09.080
However, Kenzou is not feeling any pain.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:10.700
But I don't feel pain either,

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:14.170
thanks to that Stand that
manipulated the guards into fighting.

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:15.130
But…

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.310
Even my hips!

00:20:33.390 --> 00:20:36.770
I need the direction of safety, dragon!

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:38.940
I can't reach it!

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:42.240
I'm coming your way!

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:46.160
Is he really an ally?

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:48.780
He's capable of dealing
such terrible damage.

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:50.830
Just who is this man?

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:54.370
That's it. I love that.

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:56.710
Yes, I want you to gaze at me more.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:59.920
Look at me with those eyes.

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:10.390
The direction of safety is northeast
and your lucky color is cerulean blue.

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:13.640
But you know… I think you're done for.

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:19.230
You sure aged a ton in a fight
that lasted a few minutes.

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:27.610
KENZOU (78 YEARS OLD)
STAND NAME: DRAKE'S DREAM

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:28.620
BEYOND RECOVERY

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:12.010
Are you okay, Jolyne?

00:23:12.890 --> 00:23:16.640
Yes… The pain is hitting me
all of a sudden.

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:22.100
But I have to find the bone
and the small man who picked it up.

00:23:22.810 --> 00:23:24.520
Wait just a moment.

00:23:25.020 --> 00:23:26.820
I can fill your wounds.

00:23:27.820 --> 00:23:28.990
Hurry.

00:23:29.740 --> 00:23:31.700
I have to get it back soon.

00:23:33.160 --> 00:23:34.910
My father's disc.

00:23:47.960 --> 00:23:48.840
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
